ه؛ فالمتن والباب والشرح مستويات مختلفة. تعرض الصفحة رحلته العلمية ومنهجه العام وأثره في خدمة السنة، مع إحالات إلى النصوص والشروح المعتمدة. المرجع: Britannica، مادة al-Bukhari، وصحيح البخاري وشروحه.","bio_en":"A Muslim hadith scholar renowned for collecting and critically selecting reports and for compiling al-Jami al-Sahih. The profile explains his scholarly legacy while directing readers to each hadith in its original location.","thumbnail_url":null,"website_url":"https://www.britannica.com/biography/al-Bukhari","youtube_url":null,"published":true,"metadata":{"category":"متقدمين","references":[{"url":"https://www.britannica.com/biography/al-Bukhari","title_ar":"موسوعة Britannica — البخاري","locator_ar":"Biography and hadith compilation","source_type":"academic"},{"url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari","title_ar":"صحيح البخاري — النسخة المرجعية","locator_ar":"Collection index","source_type":"hadith"}],"review_status":"editorially_reviewed_source_links","editorial_scope":"academic_and_primary_source_linked","source_verified":true,"content_depth_version":1},"created_at":"2026-11-06T19:48:39.66918+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T19:49:27.387559+00:00","searchable_normalized":"'194ه':22 '256ه':25 'a':122 'al':10,117,137,140 'al-bukhari':9,116 'al-jami':136 'al-sahih':139 'and':129,133 'britannica':114 'bukhari':11,118,158 'collecting':128 'compiling':135 'critically':130 'directing':149 'each':152 'explains':144 'for':127,134 'hadith':124,153 'his':145 'ibn':7 'in':154 'ismail':8 'its':155 'jami':138 'legacy':147 'location':157 'muhammad':6 'muslim':123 'original':156 'profile':143 'readers':150 'renowned':126 'reports':132 'sahih':141 'scholar':125 'scholarly':146 'selecting':131 'the':142 'to':151 'while':148 'احاديث':76 'احالات':108 'اختياراته':53 'اخري':70 'اسماعيل':4,14 'الابواب':65 'الاسانيد':39 'الامام':1 'الامصار':35 'البخاري':5,15,47,80,120 'التاريخ':72 'الجامع':43 'الحديث':28 'الروايات':37 'السنة':106 'الصحيح':44,77 'الصفحة':98 'العام':102 'العلماء':67 'العلمية':1