رة، وتوفي في دمشق. ينبغي دراسة أقواله ضمن سياقها ومقارنة النقول بنصوص كتبه المحققة، وعدم أخذ عبارة مبتورة من الشبكات الاجتماعية بوصفها خلاصة مذهبه. اختلف العلماء والباحثون في عدد من آرائه؛ ومن الإنصاف عرض المسألة مع نسبتها إلى مصدرها وبيان وجود النقاش العلمي حولها. المراجع: Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy، وOxford Bibliographies، وكتب التراجم.","bio_en":"A Hanbali scholar from the Mamluk period, born in 1263 and died in 1328. Modern scholarship discusses his work in theology, law, method, and the issues of his time; this profile keeps those descriptions historical and source-linked.","thumbnail_url":null,"website_url":"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/ibn-taymiyya/","youtube_url":null,"published":true,"metadata":{"field":"العقيدة والفقه والمنهج","category":"متقدمين","references":[{"url":"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/ibn-taymiyya/","title_ar":"Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy — ابن تيمية","source_type":"academic"},{"url":"https://academic.oup.com/reference/62361/reference-article-abstract/554574605","title_ar":"Oxford Bibliographies — Ibn Taymiyya","source_type":"academic"}],"review_status":"editorially_reviewed_source_links","editorial_scope":"academic_and_primary_source_linked","source_verified":true,"content_depth_version":1},"created_at":"2026-11-06T19:48:57.170734+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T19:49:27.387559+00:00","searchable_normalized":"'1263':138 '1328':142 '661ه':23 '728ه':26 'a':129 'ahmad':10 'al':8 'al-din':7 'and':139,152,164 'bibliographies':126 'born':136 'descriptions':162 'died':140 'din':9 'discusses':145 'encyclopedia':122 'from':132 'hanbali':130 'his':146,156 'historical':163 'ibn':11,169 'ibn-taymiyya':168 'in':137,141,148 'issues':154 'keeps':160 'law':150 'linked':167 'mamluk':134 'method':151 'modern':143 'of':123,155 'period':135 'philosophy':124 'profile':159 'scholar':131 'scholarship':144 'source':166 'source-linked':165 'stanford':121 'taqi':6 'taymiyya':12,170 'the':133,153 'theology':149 'this':158 'those':161 'time'